{
  "abstract": "A finite-graph formalization of nonlinear and linear QUBO penalties for the maximum k-colorable vertex-subset problem. It retains the earlier nonlinear interface and adds jointly optimized binary slack arrays, exact sequential feasibility repair, strict versus weak penalty guarantees, one-color exceptions and universal value thresholds. An unchanged companion follows the manuscript’s strict nonlinear single-slot-deletion proof.",
